  "description": "Legendary Authors Lee Hyun-se and Lee Doo-ho Present: A Short Story Collection by New Writers Now in Its Sixth Season!\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)\n\nStories Included:\n1. **Blossom** (Blossom) \\[Lipillar\\]\n2. **Ileobeorin** (잃어버린) \\[Yumapa\\]\n3. **Jiokchyeoltu** (지옥쳘투) \\[Yeongyeon\\]\n4. **Giriningan** (기린인간) \\[Hyeong-Chan Kim\\]\n5. **Sonyeosyap** (소녀샵) \\[Ji-Su Yu\\]\n6. **Jikso** (직소) \\[Han-Ui Kim\\]\n7. **Yomul Agassi** (요물 아가씨) \\[Dong-Hyeon Kim\\]\n8. **Doedori Gogae** (되돌이 고개) \\[Eun-Ji Hong\\]\n9. **LIMBO** (LIMBO) \\[Dae-Hong Sin\\]\n10. **Biwol** (비월) \\[Buchu\\]\n11. **Dokkaebibul** (도깨비불) \\[Mun-Ju Kim\\]\n12. **Neowa Naui Gyunhyeong** (너와 나의 균형) \\[SORU\\]\n13. **Annyeong** (안녕) \\[Min-Jin Kang\\]",
